Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.01,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Feeling used, but I\'m\nStill missing you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:14.45,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}And I can't see the end of this\nJust wanna feel your kiss against my lips
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:20.92,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}And now all this time is passing by\nBut I still can't seem to tell you why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:25.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}It hurts me every time I see you\nRealize how much I need you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:29.48,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.48,0:00:33.87,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate that I love you\nDon't want to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:38.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}But I can't put\nNobody else above you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:41.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:47.51,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate that I want you\nYou want her, you need her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:51.10,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}And I'll never be her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:01:00.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I miss you when I can't sleep\nOr right after coffee, or right when I can't eat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:05.90,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I miss you in my front seat\nStill got sand in my sweaters from nights we don't remember
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:12.25,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Do you miss me like I miss you?\nFucked around and got attached to you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.83,0:01:17.92,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Friends can break your heart too, and\nI'm always tired but never of you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.99,0:01:24.39,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}If I pulled a you on you, you wouldn't like that shit\nI put this reel out, but you wouldn't bite that shit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:30.40,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I type a text but then I never mind that shit\nI got these feelings but you never mind that shit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:36.05,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Oh oh, keep it on the low\nYou're still in love with me but your friends don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.05,0:01:42.06,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}If you wanted me you would just say so\nAnd if I were you, I would never let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:47.86,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I don't mean no harm\nI just miss you on my arm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:53.76,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Wedding bells were just alarms\nCaution tape around my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.45,0:01:59.84,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}You ever wonder what we could've been?\nYou said you wouldn't and you fucking did
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:06.57,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Lie to me, lie with me, get your fucking fix\nNow all my drinks and all my feelings are all fucking mixed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:11.98,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Always missing people that I shouldn't be missing\nSometimes you gotta burn some bridges just to create some distance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.98,0:02:18.27,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I know that I control my thoughts, and I should stop reminiscing\nBut I learned from my dad that it's good to have feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.27,0:02:23.58,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}When love and trust are gone\nI guess this is moving on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:30.17,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Everyone I do right does me wrong\nSo every lonely night, I sing this song
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:33.11,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:36.18,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate that I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:42.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Don't want to, but I can't put\nNobody else above you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.20,0:02:45.16,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:48.21,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}I hate that I want you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:51.14,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}You want her, you need her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:55.14,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}And I'll never be her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:03:07.86,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}All alone I watch you watch her\nLike she's the only girl you've ever seen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:20.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}You don't care, you never did\nYou don't give a damn about me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.74,0:03:31.56,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,572)\blur1.8}Yeah, all alone I watch you watch her\nShe's the only thing you've ever seen
